'''Rockruff''' (Japanese: '''イワンコ''' ''Iwanko'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

