===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Rockruff}}.
*'''Signs of Evolution''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Magikarp|75}} from the {{TCG|Skyridge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

